      "kind": "theorem",
      "statement": "Let \\(I_1,I_2\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\) be intervals. Suppose \\(g:I_1\\to I_2\\) is differentiable at \\(c\\in I_1\\), and \\(f:I_2\\to\\mathbb R\\) is differentiable at \\(g(c)\\). Then \\(f\\circ g\\) is differentiable at \\(c\\), and\n\\[(f\\circ g)'(c)=f'(g(c))g'(c).\\]",
