      "statement": "<p>Let \\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\), \\(f:S\\to\\mathbb R\\), and \\(c\\in S\\). The function has a relative maximum at \\(c\\) if there exists \\(\\delta>0\\) such that</p>\n\\[\\forall x\\in S,\\qquad |x-c|&lt;\\delta\\implies f(x)\\le f(c).\\]\n<p>It has a relative minimum at \\(c\\) if there exists \\(\\delta>0\\) such that</p>\n\\[\\forall x\\in S,\\qquad |x-c|&lt;\\delta\\implies f(x)\\ge f(c).\\]",
