      "statement": "Let \\(a&lt;b\\). If \\(f:[a,b]\\to\\mathbb R\\) is continuous on \\([a,b]\\), differentiable on \\((a,b)\\), and \\(f(a)=f(b)\\), then there exists \\(c\\in(a,b)\\) such that \\(f'(c)=0\\).",
