      "title": "The Lipschitz condition and its negation",
      "kind": "definition",
      "statement": "A function \\(f:S\\to\\mathbb R\\) is Lipschitz on \\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\) if there is \\(K\\ge0\\) such that\n\\[|f(x)-f(y)|\\le K|x-y|\\qquad(x,y\\in S).\\]",
